/* ── Icon alignment utility (base layer; theme-agnostic) ──
   Centers an SVG/img glyph inside any box with NO baseline drift. Use on the
   PARENT of a standalone icon (button, tile, logo+label row, toolbar control).
   The child `display:block` removes the inline SVG descender gap that makes a
   glyph sit low even inside a centered box. Decision rule + traps: CLAUDE.md §3.4. */
.icon-box{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
