/* ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   🕹️ Topbar feature launchers (Paper / My Day / Trading) +
   update btn — previously UNSTYLED in tofu, so they rendered as
   flat ghost buttons clashing with the beveled pixel buttons in
   the sidebar. Bring them into the same SNES-bevel language:
   warm parchment fill, light top-left / dark bottom-right border,
   JetBrains Mono label, steps() press-down. Active = kinako fill.
   ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
[data-theme="tofu"] .topbar-tool-btn,
