 * we ALREADY know is outdated (the sidebar's server-issued updatedAt is newer
 * than the cached updatedAt), mark the provisional paint visibly pending so the
 * transient pre-correction content reads as "verifying", not as truth. Cleared
 * the moment Phase-2 reconciles (or the fetch settles). Persisted corruption is
 * already prevented by the rev CAS; this only closes the cosmetic stale flash. */
